{"id":"5596","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5596_main_altocumulus-floccus-and-cirrus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>本图中有不同发展阶段的絮状高积云。我们可看到几乎<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">浑圆的新单体</span>以及<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">底部破碎的较早单体</span>。单体都没有絮状高积云非常典型的纤维状尾。还有发展到最后阶段的单体：蒸发导致的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">消散单体</span>。 </p>\n<p>有些单体呈<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">角塔状生长</span>；不可将它们列为堡状云种，因为这些单体没有共同的水平云底相连。</p>\n<p>还出现了一些不确定云种的卷云块。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Kwong Hung Tam","location":"日本，京都，右京区，嵯峨天龍寺造路町","latitude":"纬度: 35° 0' 50'' N","longitude":"经度: 135° 40' 40'' E","date":"16 November 2015 1515 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 8, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: P.4.0","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.4.0"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5596_syn_altocumulus-floccus-and-cirrus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"></div>","copyright":"© 香港特别行政区政府","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5596_upper_altocumulus-floccus-and-cirrus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>1200 UTC的探测显示在大约590-540 hPa（4500-5400米）有明显的中层云信号。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}